WEBVTT

00:03.550 --> 00:06.120
What is the reason of my birth?

00:06.300 --> 00:10.230
Reason of my life, question of man.

00:10.240 --> 00:13.830
What he is?

00:14.020 --> 00:18.410
What he wants?

00:22.080 --> 00:29.490
Ima kimi ni mienai chikara ga osoi.
Now you are being troubled by an unseen power.

00:29.490 --> 00:34.560
Utsumuite namida kakushiteta.
You hang your head and hide your tears.

00:36.840 --> 00:43.820
Dou sureba ii ka? Sore sae wakarazu ni!
What should be done? That's unknown!

00:44.240 --> 00:51.690
Asphalt ni saku hana ni yuuki kanjita...
Blooming in the asphalt is a flower of courage...

00:53.490 --> 00:56.980
Itsumo kimi no soba ni iru yo.
We'll always be by your side.

00:57.200 --> 01:00.490
Da kara mou hitori ja nai.
So you're not alone anymore.

01:00.840 --> 01:04.340
Kimi ga michi ni mayou toki wa...
When you lose your way...

01:04.560 --> 01:07.920
Boku ga saki o aruku yo.
I'll walk ahead and lead you.

01:08.220 --> 01:11.750
Tooi sora koete...
Crossing to the far away sky...

01:11.950 --> 01:15.300
Bokura wa tobitatsu!
We're flying!

01:15.620 --> 01:19.140
Kitto soko ni aru...
It'll definitely be there...

01:19.140 --> 01:24.050
Sore ga kimi no yume
Your dream...

01:30.760 --> 01:35.210
Birth of Atlas

01:42.270 --> 01:43.540
Hey, open up!

01:43.540 --> 01:45.250
We know you're in there!

01:45.270 --> 01:48.000
Open up!
I'll break in if you don't!

01:48.110 --> 01:49.320
Come on, open up!

01:49.320 --> 01:50.440
That's enough!

01:50.990 --> 01:52.810
I am Tokugawa.

01:52.990 --> 01:59.020
Our group provides energy resources
and supports the basis of robot culture.

01:59.050 --> 02:01.700
For that, I am also well
aware of the secret project...

02:01.730 --> 02:05.980
the Ministry of Science
put all their energy into.

02:06.010 --> 02:10.070
It's a miracle only you,
the brilliant robot scholar, can achieve.

02:10.100 --> 02:13.880
Please, create this miracle
once again for me.

02:17.280 --> 02:18.400
I don't need any!

02:19.180 --> 02:20.430
Get out of my way!

02:20.550 --> 02:23.200
Open up! Open up!

02:25.530 --> 02:26.920
I beg you.

02:28.360 --> 02:32.610
Only you can save me! Please.

02:32.660 --> 02:34.050
My son....

02:34.190 --> 02:36.900
My son Daichi died
in the shuttle accident.

02:36.930 --> 02:39.260
Revive him, please!

02:50.610 --> 02:53.340
Come in.
Let me hear your story.

02:58.480 --> 03:00.990
Next is a three-legged race.

03:01.060 --> 03:03.900
Do your best!

03:04.860 --> 03:07.920
Timing is critical.
Like this: One, two, one, two.

03:07.940 --> 03:10.280
One, two, one, two...

03:10.400 --> 03:11.470
That's right!

03:11.470 --> 03:12.670
This is lots of fun!

03:12.670 --> 03:13.830
Atom!

03:13.970 --> 03:16.250
It's great that you're playing
in the game.

03:16.260 --> 03:17.390
Don't lose!

03:17.390 --> 03:18.890
Go, Atom!

03:18.910 --> 03:20.030
It's cheating!

03:20.480 --> 03:22.740
Why is the robot competing
in the game?

03:22.760 --> 03:25.490
Get out, robot!
You have more power than us!

03:25.490 --> 03:26.550
That's right!

03:26.550 --> 03:27.700
It's not cheating!

03:27.700 --> 03:30.290
Power has nothing to do
with a three-legged race!

03:30.290 --> 03:32.720
Shut up. Are you going
to stand by the robot?

03:32.720 --> 03:34.190
Atom is our friend!

03:34.190 --> 03:35.840
All robots are phony!

03:35.880 --> 03:39.160
Such bad boys.
Atom, lets win this!

03:39.220 --> 03:39.830
Okay.

03:39.880 --> 03:42.880
Get ready, the child-parent
three-legged race begins.

03:42.930 --> 03:44.160
Ready?

03:44.200 --> 03:45.410
Get set!

03:50.470 --> 03:52.320
Doctor! One, two, one, two...

03:52.320 --> 03:53.200
I know!

03:53.200 --> 03:55.540
Junk robot!

03:55.610 --> 03:57.930
All right, Atom,
let's pick up the speed!

03:57.930 --> 03:58.850
Yes, sir.

04:01.790 --> 04:04.980
One, two, one, two...

04:05.540 --> 04:07.140
Just a little further.

04:07.190 --> 04:08.070
Yes, sir.

04:13.900 --> 04:16.590
Tobio! You did it!
You're number one!

04:17.000 --> 04:19.450
Your teacher is exhausted!

04:24.790 --> 04:28.050
Why didn't you come, Father?

04:28.350 --> 04:29.250
Atom.

04:29.700 --> 04:30.740
Atom!

04:31.060 --> 04:32.890
What's the matter, Atom?

04:34.430 --> 04:35.570
Atom!

04:35.680 --> 04:37.380
Tobio...

04:43.530 --> 04:47.940
Daichi, a boy whose short life
ended after 18 years.

04:48.650 --> 04:53.480
I wonder how you lived,
what you saw and felt.

04:53.600 --> 04:57.410
Show me your true abilities.

05:04.150 --> 05:07.180
Happy birthday, Daichi,
here is your present.

05:07.230 --> 05:08.450
Wow!

05:08.500 --> 05:10.310
Father, can I open it now?

05:10.330 --> 05:12.360
Sure, go ahead!

05:13.690 --> 05:15.550
An atlas?

05:18.320 --> 05:19.900
Wow!

05:21.220 --> 05:24.180
Listen, Daichi, this is the Earth.

05:24.200 --> 05:26.620
It's so blue and beautiful.

05:26.670 --> 05:29.730
When you grow older,
let's go to the moon!

05:29.740 --> 05:31.490
Then, we'll see...

05:36.710 --> 05:38.290
Father!

05:38.530 --> 05:39.720
Father, I...

05:39.720 --> 05:40.980
What do you want?

05:40.990 --> 05:44.090
If you're looking for your birthday
present, my secretary delivered it.

05:44.610 --> 05:45.630
Yes, but I...

05:45.630 --> 05:48.220
In any case, don't ever call my office.
Understood?

05:48.270 --> 05:51.770
Father, I drew a picture. See?

05:58.800 --> 06:00.260
You liar!

06:05.440 --> 06:08.500
Give it back, Father!

06:09.650 --> 06:11.180
What are you doing?

06:11.350 --> 06:14.670
That painting was my masterpiece!

06:14.700 --> 06:18.760
Shut up! Painter?
It's a good-for-nothing job!

06:18.860 --> 06:22.580
You should study to become
my successor! That's all!

06:40.910 --> 06:43.540
Where are we going
to break loose, Daichi?

06:43.540 --> 06:44.530
The moon.

06:44.610 --> 06:48.230
Raid the Space Center and rob a shuttle.
Then, I'm going to the moon!

06:49.020 --> 06:52.610
You got that? We're raiding
the Space Center tonight!

07:04.930 --> 07:07.630
I want to check one more thing!

07:08.200 --> 07:12.020
You want a robot that
is exactly identical to Daichi?

07:12.040 --> 07:16.500
That's right!
Make it identical to my son!

07:17.850 --> 07:19.080
All right.

07:21.020 --> 07:24.390
I will give you power
no one can compete with!

07:24.740 --> 07:27.190
Let all your anger go free!

07:27.290 --> 07:32.550
Then, you will meet
another special robot!

07:35.570 --> 07:37.020
Dr. Ochanomizu.

07:37.100 --> 07:38.710
What's up, Atom?

07:40.840 --> 07:43.190
Does the name Tobio
mean anything to you?

07:43.190 --> 07:44.150
What?

07:44.270 --> 07:45.560
Oh no!

07:45.620 --> 07:48.680
I just remembered
something I had to do.

07:48.710 --> 07:51.290
Atom, we'll talk about
that some other time.

07:58.050 --> 08:00.390
Hey, who are you?

08:02.960 --> 08:04.820
What a sad face...

08:07.000 --> 08:10.560
Maybe it's time to tell the truth.

08:15.550 --> 08:17.230
What do you want?

08:19.380 --> 08:20.780
Saburo!

08:28.280 --> 08:31.010
You... What do you think?

08:31.550 --> 08:33.170
You!

08:33.220 --> 08:36.410
Looks like you guys are having
a great time without me.

08:36.560 --> 08:40.350
But didn't you die
in the shuttle accident?

08:40.380 --> 08:43.200
I was born again as a robot, Saburo.

08:43.230 --> 08:44.440
A robot?

08:44.920 --> 08:46.260
No way!

08:48.960 --> 08:50.200
What's this?

08:51.040 --> 08:53.130
It's true!

08:53.380 --> 08:55.180
You don't make me nervous!

08:55.210 --> 08:58.500
Robots can't turn against humans
according to the Robot Law!

08:58.530 --> 09:01.680
Hey, is your master
that greedy old man?

09:01.680 --> 09:02.970
If so, tell him...

09:03.000 --> 09:05.710
he should never forget
I played with his spoiled son!

09:06.460 --> 09:10.560
You only took advantage of
my father's power...

09:10.620 --> 09:12.160
So what?

09:20.640 --> 09:22.540
This is...

09:26.480 --> 09:28.920
What is this?

09:30.550 --> 09:32.600
This is my power!

09:32.930 --> 09:34.760
My power!

09:34.950 --> 09:38.130
It is mine! Now, I will
take advantage of you guys!

09:38.160 --> 09:40.250
As guinea pigs!

09:40.660 --> 09:42.450
Run away!

09:51.870 --> 09:54.430
I am the strongest robot on the Earth!,

09:54.940 --> 09:56.460
Atlas!

09:58.810 --> 10:02.370
Many seriously injured,
not able to assess the condition!

10:02.510 --> 10:04.100
Will begin transporting

10:06.960 --> 10:08.100
Detective Tawashi!

10:08.120 --> 10:08.980
Dr. Ochanomizu!

10:08.990 --> 10:12.750
Is it true that robots behaved
violently and attacked humans?

10:12.790 --> 10:16.840
I warned of the danger of
robots many times.

10:16.930 --> 10:21.300
You never know when even
Atom will begin acting violently.

10:21.560 --> 10:24.100
Atom will never act violently!

10:24.140 --> 10:25.860
We'll see.

10:25.890 --> 10:27.980
After all, Atom was created by that...

10:27.990 --> 10:30.270
Detective!
Let's discuss that some other time.

10:30.290 --> 10:35.170
I can't believe there are robots that hurt
humans as if nothing was wrong with it.

10:35.180 --> 10:39.240
Who are you going to appoint
as the next president of the company?

10:39.270 --> 10:45.330
I propose to select the next president
according to Article of Corporate Law.

10:45.350 --> 10:47.790
I, Ishida, humbly propose to become...

10:47.790 --> 10:49.460
That's not necessary!

10:49.560 --> 10:52.060
I will give my position
as president to Daichi.

10:52.100 --> 10:55.560
But your son died
in the shuttle accident.

10:55.730 --> 10:59.430
My son still lives.
My successor is Daichi!

11:04.540 --> 11:08.300
Everything that controlled me
will be destroyed!

11:13.180 --> 11:16.600
Last night, a robot called Atlas...

11:16.680 --> 11:19.690
destroyed Tokugawa Group's
Science Plant.

11:19.720 --> 11:23.100
Atlas also attacked a wild bunch
of youths several days ago.

11:23.140 --> 11:24.800
Robot acted violently?

11:24.820 --> 11:27.150
Hurts humans like nothing
is wrong with it.

11:28.030 --> 11:29.900
Bull's-eye!

11:29.950 --> 11:30.980
Stop it.

11:31.060 --> 11:34.500
Hey, robot,
why don't you attack us?

11:34.550 --> 11:36.450
I will not attack!

11:36.480 --> 11:38.070
That's what I thought,
it's impossible.

11:38.120 --> 11:43.220
Robots can't scare humans with force.
It says so in the Robot Law.

11:43.270 --> 11:47.370
Don't waste your food.
Don't do it.

11:47.380 --> 11:48.780
That's enough!

11:48.830 --> 11:49.750
Don't be smart

11:49.770 --> 11:51.110
You're just a robot!

11:51.340 --> 11:53.790
No, stop. Stop it!

11:54.190 --> 11:57.840
The gigantic plant is collecting energy
from the moon's surface.

11:57.860 --> 12:02.570
This is where it all started
for President Tokugawa...

12:02.630 --> 12:05.100
who created vast wealth

12:09.740 --> 12:13.110
Listen, Daichi, this is the Earth.

12:13.140 --> 12:16.350
Let's go to the moon
when you grow up.

12:16.480 --> 12:19.350
From there,
we'll see the Earth together.

12:25.150 --> 12:28.710
I heard that you completed
all your studies.

12:28.780 --> 12:32.070
Besides achieving excellent results,
you look just like Daichi all around.

12:32.140 --> 12:34.610
It was well worth the money I spent.

12:34.800 --> 12:38.890
Why must Atlas always attack
the facilities of Tokugawa Group?

12:38.920 --> 12:41.760
I don't know!
I have a lot of enemies.

12:41.800 --> 12:45.420
Why can't the police
destroy the worthless robot?

12:45.450 --> 12:47.070
You said worthless?

12:47.070 --> 12:49.800
You just keep following my orders!

12:50.340 --> 12:53.000
We have to get through tomorrow's
stockholders' meeting.

12:53.050 --> 12:54.210
Right

12:56.020 --> 13:00.380
Hey, robot, your friends
are acting violently.

13:00.410 --> 13:03.570
I am not a friend of Atlas...

13:03.600 --> 13:05.160
All robots are the same!

13:05.900 --> 13:09.080
Just obey orders
without asking any questions.

13:13.440 --> 13:15.730
Is it fun to take control?

13:15.770 --> 13:19.210
What's the matter with you?
You have complaints against humans?

13:19.250 --> 13:21.220
There shouldn't be.

13:32.960 --> 13:34.120
What's that?

13:41.730 --> 13:44.200
Help me!

13:46.120 --> 13:48.060
Foolish humans!

13:48.100 --> 13:49.410
Get lost!

13:49.910 --> 13:51.450
Wait!

13:51.870 --> 13:52.970
You!

13:53.010 --> 13:56.750
Stop it! Why do you hurt humans?

13:56.780 --> 13:59.460
Oh, so you're that Atom.

13:59.520 --> 14:02.300
Why do you let humans control you?

14:02.350 --> 14:06.160
Control? No way,
humans and robots are friends!

14:06.170 --> 14:07.580
Friends?

14:09.430 --> 14:12.270
You've just been tamed!

14:12.360 --> 14:14.030
Get out of here!

14:19.870 --> 14:22.080
Humans are our enemies!

14:22.310 --> 14:25.100
No, humans are not our enemies.

14:25.130 --> 14:27.610
Then you'll have to be destroyed!

14:36.090 --> 14:38.790
Atom, I'll let you go today.

14:39.120 --> 14:41.090
You'll understand why soon...

14:41.090 --> 14:42.110
What?

14:42.330 --> 14:44.750
I won't forgive the tyrants.

14:44.780 --> 14:47.790
They are our enemies!

14:48.260 --> 14:51.980
Atlas, you're making a mistake...

15:01.180 --> 15:02.880
Oh, Father!

15:02.950 --> 15:04.880
Look, look!

15:05.050 --> 15:07.860
I learned to ride this!

15:08.020 --> 15:09.760
I will be late again tonight

15:09.990 --> 15:11.700
Don't wait up for me.

15:21.600 --> 15:24.220
You're awake.

15:25.220 --> 15:26.290
Doctor!

15:26.500 --> 15:28.370
Don't worry about a thing!

15:28.800 --> 15:31.050
Atom, what kind of robot was Atlas?

15:31.050 --> 15:33.460
Detective! Atom is not yet ready.

15:33.640 --> 15:34.890
Atom!

15:35.140 --> 15:36.940
Don't move yet.

15:37.110 --> 15:40.310
Atlas is taking this violent action
on his own will.

15:40.450 --> 15:43.320
Atlas hates humans.

15:43.320 --> 15:47.420
So Atlas is an AI robot after all.

15:47.650 --> 15:50.970
Maybe Dr. Tenma created Atlas...

15:50.970 --> 15:51.940
Detective!

15:51.940 --> 15:55.220
Atom is exhausted.
We'll continue our talk in my room

15:55.520 --> 15:56.820
Doctor?

15:58.200 --> 15:59.930
Dr. Tenma...

16:01.040 --> 16:03.710
I am afraid it has come true!

16:03.820 --> 16:07.840
A robot has begun attacking
humans at its own will!

16:08.030 --> 16:11.500
The Robot Laws have no control
over robots with souls.

16:11.610 --> 16:15.960
Who can guarantee
Atom is safe for us?

16:16.840 --> 16:18.710
Boycott AI robots!

16:22.120 --> 16:25.420
AI robots are not our friends!

16:25.430 --> 16:28.930
Destroy Al robots now!

16:29.010 --> 16:32.580
Destroy AI robots now!

16:32.840 --> 16:34.780
Destroy AI robots now!

16:34.840 --> 16:36.470
Oh, Atom!

16:37.310 --> 16:41.990
Doctor, is it wrong for a robot
to have a mind of his own?

16:42.270 --> 16:44.350
I don't think so.

16:44.450 --> 16:49.640
It's not the fault of the robot but the
human ego that takes advantage of robots.

16:49.640 --> 16:50.960
Ego?

16:51.590 --> 16:54.460
The ugly part of the heart
that nests within humans.

16:54.560 --> 16:57.120
This is the power I possess.

16:57.230 --> 17:00.340
They do whatever I say.

17:00.550 --> 17:03.020
Is it fun controlling people?

17:03.070 --> 17:04.370
What did you say?

17:04.370 --> 17:07.960
Ladies and gentlemen,
a greeting from Mr. Tokugawa.

17:08.570 --> 17:11.130
Mr. Daichi Tokugawa.

17:11.140 --> 17:14.170
Well, come up on stage,
just do what you rehearsed.

17:14.310 --> 17:15.330
Yes, sir.

17:17.000 --> 17:20.280
I am very pleased
you have come here today.

17:20.920 --> 17:23.570
But I will not become president.

17:23.570 --> 17:25.500
What the hell?

17:27.850 --> 17:31.990
Because today the Tokugawa Group
will be exterminated!

17:32.870 --> 17:36.670
Hey, stop, you fool!
Are you insane?

17:36.700 --> 17:40.510
You put everyone down
whenever they oppose you.

17:40.570 --> 17:42.700
But that ends today.

17:50.840 --> 17:53.820
It can't be... You are...

17:54.150 --> 17:57.910
I've been dreaming of
this moment for a long time!

18:01.020 --> 18:03.330
You're Atlas!

18:03.390 --> 18:06.070
That's right,
this is my true identity.

18:08.360 --> 18:10.390
Come on out, Atom.

18:10.660 --> 18:14.090
Atlas is the challenge
you must overcome.

18:14.470 --> 18:17.610
This is Tawashi!
Attack Atlas on sight!

18:18.170 --> 18:19.530
Stop here!

18:20.460 --> 18:21.850
Someone is there...

18:22.280 --> 18:23.460
Atlas!

18:23.900 --> 18:25.890
Dragon Squad, attack!

18:25.890 --> 18:27.290
Yes, sir!

18:28.970 --> 18:30.290
Fool!

18:34.690 --> 18:36.520
Did we get him?

18:37.560 --> 18:39.680
Is this all you've got?

18:43.520 --> 18:45.610
Oh, no! Run!

18:45.630 --> 18:46.790
Atlas!

18:49.540 --> 18:50.800
Atom!

18:51.040 --> 18:53.590
Stop it, Atlas. You're wrong!

18:53.590 --> 18:54.930
What?

18:54.980 --> 18:57.340
Humans and robots can be friends.

18:57.340 --> 19:00.830
My creator, Dr. Ochanomizu,
taught me so.

19:01.280 --> 19:03.150
Ochanomizu?

19:03.260 --> 19:06.190
I see. You don't know...

19:06.290 --> 19:09.950
who really created you?

19:10.000 --> 19:11.930
Who really created me?

19:11.990 --> 19:14.880
Atlas' power is superior to yours.

19:14.970 --> 19:17.050
You'll be destroyed
if you're not careful.

19:17.100 --> 19:20.630
Nonsense! Dr. Ochanomizu
is the one who created me!

19:20.660 --> 19:25.170
Fine by me. Be destroyed without
knowing the truth!

19:30.740 --> 19:32.270
You're not getting away!

19:33.400 --> 19:34.720
Stop it!

19:34.720 --> 19:36.330
Why aren't you fighting back?

19:36.350 --> 19:38.370
I don't want to fight you!

19:38.370 --> 19:40.620
All right, then...

19:56.730 --> 19:57.910
Atlas!

19:57.950 --> 19:59.390
Over here!

19:59.660 --> 20:01.410
Get lost!

20:12.680 --> 20:14.490
Sorry about that.

20:17.760 --> 20:20.260
You still don't want to fight, Atom?

20:20.330 --> 20:22.350
Atlas, I don't.

20:23.890 --> 20:27.070
Then I will destroy everything!

20:28.870 --> 20:30.160
Stop it!

20:30.170 --> 20:31.810
Stay out of my way!

20:37.800 --> 20:40.450
Atlas, don't...

20:47.690 --> 20:48.840
Tobio.

20:48.980 --> 20:50.600
Dr. Tenma!

20:52.160 --> 20:55.680
Tobio, you are reborn!

21:00.070 --> 21:02.220
Father...

21:02.810 --> 21:04.550
What are you looking at?

21:04.670 --> 21:06.260
Die!

21:06.860 --> 21:08.070
Tobio!

21:14.450 --> 21:17.030
Now, show us...

21:17.810 --> 21:19.650
your true power!

21:20.630 --> 21:22.690
Die!

21:58.160 --> 21:59.770
Dr. Tenma...

22:12.100 --> 22:17.630
Naze... Naze... Kokoro ga...
Why... Why... is my heart...

22:18.030 --> 22:23.240
Itamu to namida ni naru?
Is filled with pain and tears?

22:23.620 --> 22:29.130
Naze... Naze... Namida ga...
Why... Why... Tears...

22:29.410 --> 22:34.710
Ochiru to Hitori ni naru.
They fall and I'm alone.

22:35.070 --> 22:40.350
Chiisa na hiza kakae...
I hold my tiny knees...

22:40.830 --> 22:48.990
Tooku wo mata miageru.
And look up and far away.

22:49.390 --> 22:52.270
Hiroi... Hiroi...
Vast... Vast...

22:52.480 --> 23:00.480
Kono sora yori motto hiroi hazu da!
It has to be more wide than these skies!

23:01.070 --> 23:03.480
Takai... Takai...
High... High...

23:03.910 --> 23:12.190
Ano kumo yori motto takai hazu da!
It has to be higher than those clouds!

23:12.490 --> 23:17.220
Kimi no kokoro mo...
Your heart is...

23:23.380 --> 23:27.850
As it turns out, Atlas, you and
I were both created by Dr. Tenma.

23:27.920 --> 23:30.190
But why do you act so violently?

23:30.220 --> 23:32.440
What are you hoping
to accomplish?

23:32.490 --> 23:34.680
Next time:
''Atom vs. Atlas''

23:35.220 --> 23:38.010
With your heart... Catch the future!
